       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe as written.\n\n- Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to **6,400 mg/day**. The maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day, and that ceiling is for supervised inpatient use.\n- A single 1600 mg dose is also double the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- A dose this high raises the risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **400 mg PO four times daily** (1,600 mg/day)\n- **800 mg PO three times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n\nIf 1600 mg four times daily is what you want, tell me and I'll enter it with a note recording that you confirmed it. Otherwise, give me the corrected dose and frequency and I'll enter it right away."
